{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261013%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%9C%B0%E7%9B%A4%E5%B7%A5%E6%B6%89%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88%E5%BC%B7%E5%A7%A6%E5%A5%B3%E7%AB%A5-%E4%BB%8A%E7%8D%B2%E6%92%A4%E6%8E%A7-893x1024.jpg\" width=\"893\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>31歲地盤工涉於今年3月在單位內強姦一名女童，他被控一項強姦罪，案件今（13日）在沙田裁判法院再提堂，司法機構文件顯示，被告已獲撤控。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告葉偉文（31歲，報稱地盤工人）被控於今年3月10日，在沙田大圍沙角街5號沙角邨某單位內強姦女童X。</p>\n<p>法院：沙田裁判法院<br/>法官：裁判官黃國輝<br/>被告：葉偉文<br/>控罪：強姦<br/>案件編號：STCC1196/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:07.210495+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T10:56:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.724068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.724068+00:00","content_hash":"3ea7f24572effff7e52ce80787755ba3fbdf4753affa30d5ae19bffc1c50810d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_repaired_at":null,"content_capture":null}